{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1598","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. The Sum of Good Numbers"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call a positive integer "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if there is no digit "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in its decimal representation."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For an array of a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" numbers $$$a$$$, one found out that the sum of some two neighboring elements is equal to $$$x$$$ (i.e. $$$x = a_i + a_{i + 1}$$$ for some $$$i$$$). $$$x$$$ had turned out to be a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number as well."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then the elements of the array $$$a$$$ were written out one after another without separators into one string $$$s$$$. For example, if $$$a = [12, 5, 6, 133]$$$, then $$$s = 1256133$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$s$$$ and a number $$$x$$$. Your task is to determine the positions in the string that correspond to the adjacent elements of the array that have sum $$$x$$$. If there are several possible answers, you can print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains the string $$$s$$$ ($$$2 \\le |s| \\le 5 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains an integer $$$x$$$ ($$$2 \\le x \\lt 10^{200000}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An additional constraint on the input: the answer always exists, i.e you can always select two adjacent substrings of the string $$$s$$$ so that if you convert these substrings to integers, their sum is equal to $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line, print two integers $$$l_1$$$, $$$r_1$$$, meaning that the first term of the sum ($$$a_i$$$) is in the string $$$s$$$ from position $$$l_1$$$ to position $$$r_1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second line, print two integers $$$l_2$$$, $$$r_2$$$, meaning that the second term of the sum ($$$a_{i + 1}$$$) is in the string $$$s$$$ from position $$$l_2$$$ to position $$$r_2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1256133\n17\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1 2\n3 3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9544715561\n525\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2 3\n4 6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n239923\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1 1\n2 2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1218633757639\n976272\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2 7\n8 13\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example $$$s[1;2] = 12$$$ and $$$s[3;3] = 5$$$, $$$12+5=17$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example $$$s[2;3] = 54$$$ and $$$s[4;6] = 471$$$, $$$54+471=525$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example $$$s[1;1] = 2$$$ and $$$s[2;2] = 3$$$, $$$2+3=5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fourth example $$$s[2;7] = 218633$$$ and $$$s[8;13] = 757639$$$, $$$218633+757639=976272$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"G","problemCode":"1598G","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1598/problem/G"}